# Example env rows for the feat `req` feature (spec: feat/back/spec/req.md), mounted via
# the backend-slots loader (spec: feat/back/spec/backend-slots.md).
# The _MOUNT row is the slot config: present = feature attached at that path, absent = dormant.
# Recipes = FEAT_REQ_<NAME>_*; presence of _TARGET enables the route <mount>/<name>.
# Reference recipe: retrigger a project's last serf deploy run via flow /retrigger.
# {{project}} is filled from the caller's param (public by contract — no secrets there).
FEAT_REQ_MOUNT=/req
FEAT_REQ_RETRIGGER_TARGET=https://flow-back-host/retrigger
FEAT_REQ_RETRIGGER_METHOD=post
FEAT_REQ_RETRIGGER_HEADERS={"Authorization": "Bearer <APP_TRIGGER_RUN_TOKEN>"}
FEAT_REQ_RETRIGGER_BODY={"project": "{{project}}"}
